hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"46","[AI-translation] Hamain Sufyan bin Waki' ne hadith kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamain mere aba ne hadith kiya, Sharik se, Uthman bin Mawahib se, kehte hain: Abu Hurairah se poocha gaya: Kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne khazab kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Haan."
"47","[AI-translation] Hamain Ibrahim bin Harun ne hadith kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamain Al-Nadr bin Zurarah ne khabar di, Abu Janab se, Iyad bin Laqit se, Al-Jahdamah se, Bishr bin Al-Khasasiyyah ki biwi, unhon ne kaha: Main ne khud Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko dekha ke apne ghar se nikle hue apne sar ko jhaad rahe the aur unhon ne ghusal kiya tha, aur un ke sar mein mehndi ka lepan tha, ya unhon ne kaha: keechad, is shaykh ne is mein shak kiya."
"48","[AI-translation] Hamain Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman ne hadith kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamain Amr bin Asim ne hadith kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamain Hammad bin Salmah ne hadith kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamain Humayd ne hadith kiya, Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke baal khizab kiye hue dekhe."
"49","[AI-translation] Hammad ne kaha: Aur hamain Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqil ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke baal Anas bin Malik ke paas khizab kiye hue dekhe."
"50","[AI-translation] Hamain Muhammad bin Humayd Al-Razi ne hadith kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamain Abu Dawud Al-Tayalisi ne hadith kiya, Abbad bin Mansur se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ithmid se surma lagao, beshak woh nazar ko roshan karta hai aur baal ugata hai. Aur (rawi) ne zikr kiya ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki ek surmedani thi jis se woh har raat surma lagate the, is mein teen dafa aur is mein teen dafa."
